<title>MALAYSIA: Sime UEP 6-mth net at 65.1 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Sime UEP 6-mth net at 65.1 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, '96</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  65.1    vs	  52.8</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 16.1    vs	  13.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   271.8    vs	 224.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    94.4    vs	  76.6</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    4.5    vs	   0.1</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.0    vs	   7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian property firm Sime UEP Properties Bhd is a subsidiary of Sime Darby Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
